Subject: [PATCH 08/13] [M156] [webcodecs] Route callbacks to execution context
 task runners

Original change's description:
> [webcodecs] Route callbacks to execution context task runners
>
> Route WebCodecs encoder, readback, GPU factory retrieval, and
> ImageDecoderExternal callbacks through execution-context task runners
> instead of SequencedTaskRunner::GetCurrentDefault(), so tasks are
> deferred when a page or worker is paused or frozen.
>
> Bug: 576082223, 580866733, 578659916
> Change-Id: Id471895d1c152fd476c98a9595c1a917047f5bfb
